This project follows a strict architecture.

Stack:
- HTML
- CSS
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Supabase backend

Frameworks are NOT allowed.

Project structure:

index.html
styles.css
scripts/

Main scripts:
scripts/main-supabase.js
scripts/cart-persistent.js
scripts/auth-status.js

Client dashboard:

client/dashboard.html
client/dashboard.js
client/dashboard-instant.js
client/dashboard.css

Rules:

- dashboard.js handles authentication only
- dashboard-instant.js renders the UI
- catalog logic must remain separate from dashboard logic
- do not introduce new frameworks
- do not refactor architecture without explicit request
